    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66827" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετανίστημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>remove from his</i> or <i>their country</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.5.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἄλλας πόλεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					9.26.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>remove</i>, i. e. <i>avert</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ χείριστα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>D.</u>
					1.19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, c. aor. 2 et pf.
			
				Act.
			, <i>remove, migrate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.114
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				175
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.514
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				44.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς χῶρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.51
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				4.85
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῶν ἄνω τόπων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.37
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.25
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. Πελοποννήσου</span>
			<i>emigrate from</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Conon
				47.1
			</span></i>.</div>
